OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry and mostly cloudy in the
OL,6,Fmorning and most of the afternoon with
OL,7,Fsome bright intervals. Rain and hill
OL,8,Fsnow, heavy at times, spreading east
OL,9,Ffrom late afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStrong
OL,12,Fwinds, rain and hills snow early
OL,13,FFriday clearing to bright spells and
OL,14,Fshowers. Bright spells and a few
OL,15,Fshowers possible on Saturday. Heavy
OL,16,Fshowers spreading east Sunday. Often
OL,17,Fwindy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
